<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Adtran cut by SoundView.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Adtran cut by SoundView.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial Group said analyst Chandan Sarkar downgraded his short- and long-term ratings on Adtran Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Sarkar said he was seeing deteriorating fundamentals in Adtran's businesses.</p>
<p>-- said growth in ISDN in the U.S. appeared to be slowing.</p>
<p>-- maintained earnings estimates at $0.86 for fiscal 1997 and $1.13 for fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>-- shares were up 7/8 to 27-7/8.</p>
</text>
